==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 16~20 seconds<sup>480f~600f</sup>.
*7 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Since this stage is filled with just [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red Enemies]], using any of the [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] will easily clear this stage.

